- `clj -M:kondo --lint` on the six files: 0 errors, 0 warnings.
- `mise exec -- cljstyle check` on the six files: clean.

## Scope checks

C4 stays AST-level: no `:yin.code/*` matching and no pinned A addresses.
Edited files are ASCII apart from the pre-existing section sign in docstrings (house
